p://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-credit-card size-5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="5" rx="2"></rect><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="10" y2="10"></line><path d="M6 14h2"></path></svg></div><div><h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground font-heading uppercase tracking-wider">Direct Bank Transfer Endpoint</h4><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground font-semibold">NEFT / RTGS / IMPS instructions for enterprise subscribers</p></div></div><div class="space-y-2.5 rounded-lg bg-muted/40 p-3.5 border border-border/50 text-sm"><div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-border/40"><span class="text-muted-foreground font-medium">Bank Name:</span><span class="font-bold text-foreground">HDFC Bank</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-border/40"><span class="text-muted-foreground font-medium">Account Name:</span><span class="font-bold text-foreground">Bill Matrix Technologies</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-border/40"><span class="text-muted-foreground font-medium">Account Number:</span><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono font-bold text-foreground"><span>50200012345678</span><button type="button" class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-indigo-600 transition cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy size-4" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="text-muted-foreground font-medium">IFSC Code:</span><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-mono font-bold text-foreground"><span>HDFC0000123</span><button type="button" class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-indigo-600 transition cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy size-4" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div><div class="md:col-span-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-xs space-y-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check size-5 text-indigo-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg><h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground font-heading uppercase tracking-wider">Platform Admin Authorization Security</h4></div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">Allowlist source</p><div class="rounded-lg bg-muted/40 p-3 border border-border/50 text-sm font-mono text-foreground font-bold break-all">Managed in server configuration. Only verified identities are accepted.</div></div><div class="md:col-span-2 rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5 shadow-xs space-y-3"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><div class="rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 p-2 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7"></path><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"></rect></svg></div><div><h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-foreground font-heading uppercase tracking-wider">Feedback &amp; Bug Report Inbox Dispatch</h4><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground font-semibold">Live destination for all user reviews, bug reports &amp; UI/UX suggestions</p></div></div><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 text-xs font-bold border border-emerald-500/20 self-start sm:self-auto"><span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>Active In-Memory Delivery (0 Cloud/DB Storage)</div></div><p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">When users submit bug reports or feedback via the topbar or settings form, the payload and screenshots are packaged in-memory and delivered via Resend directly to your inbox. You can reply directly to the submitting user from Gmail.</p><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 pt-1"><div class="rounded-lg bg-muted/40 p-3 border border-border/50 text-sm"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Active Recipient Email</span><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono font-bold text-foreground">support@billmatrix.in</span><button type="button" class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-indigo-600 transition cursor-pointer"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy size-4" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-muted/40 p-3 border border-border/50 text-sm"><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1">Environment Override Variable</span><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-foreground font-bold">FEEDBACK_RECIPIENT_EMAIL</code><span class="text-[11px] text-muted-foreground font-medium">Update in .env to change</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"`;

