ive</span></div><div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-1 sm:gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap"><div class="flex items-baseline gap-1"><span class="text-2xl font-black font-heading text-slate-900">0</span><span class="text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-slate-500 font-medium"> Clients</span></div><span class="text-slate-300 font-light px-0.5">•</span><div class="flex items-baseline gap-1"><span class="text-2xl font-black font-heading text-slate-900">0</span><span class="text-xs sm:text-[13px] text-slate-500 font-medium"> Items</span></div></div><div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-100 px-2 py-1 text-[11.5px] sm:text-xs text-slate-600 whitespace-nowrap"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check size-3.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="truncate">Unlimited Customers &amp; Products</span></div></div><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2 pt-1.5 border-t border-slate-200/60">Search products by name or HSN/SAC</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200/70 bg-slate-50/50 p-3 sm:p-3.5 flex flex-col justify-between"><div><div class="flex items-center justify-between text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500 mb-1.5"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check size-4 text-emerald-600" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>Automation Status</span><span class="text-xs font-bold text-indigo-700 bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200/8